    },
    "description": "<p>At the start of your turn during a conflict, if you are driving your <strong>personal vehicle</strong>, you may spend 10 Mind Points<strong>.</strong> If you do, choose one option:</p><ul><li><p>The next time you deal damage during this turn, deal <strong>【SL × 2】</strong> extra damage.</p></li><li><p>The next time you suffer damage before the start of your next turn, that damage is reduced by <strong>【SL × 2】</strong> (applied before damage Affinities).</p></li><li><p>You recover from either <strong>slow</strong> or <strong>weak</strong> (your choice).</p></li></ul>",
